  array([[0],
         [3]])

  Here `condition` is a 2-axis integer tensor, with 3 non-zero values. The
  result has a shape of `[3, 2]`.

  >>> tf.where([[1, 0, 0], [1, 0, 1]]).numpy()
  array([[0, 0],
         [1, 0],
         [1, 2]])

  Here `condition` is a 3-axis float tensor, with 5 non-zero values. The output
  shape is `[5, 3]`.

